'''Nubobo''' is a [[:Category:Special Cats|Special Cat]] that was implemented in [[Version 3.1.1 Update|Version 3.1.1]] and is from the [[Dragon League Collaboration Event]]. It can be unlocked by achieving 1 win in the Nyanko Battle Arena in Dragon League during the event.

{{Cat Info
|ID = 157
|rarity = EX
|name1 = Nubobo
|name2 = Gorubo
}}

==Evolution==
Evolves into '''Gorubo''' at level 10.

==Strategy/Usage==
[[Rocker Cat (Rare Cat)|Rocker Cat]] makes this unit entirely irrelevant. Therefore, this Cat is only useful for increasing your [[User Rank]], as its stats aren't viable for anything more than that.

{{Job|Classification = User Rank Dump}}

